{
  "name": "MENTION---On-Mention-Handler",
  "active": true,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RFC-007: Mention Service Handler\n\n**Webhook:** POST /mention\n\n**Input:**\n- guild_id (requis)\n- user_id (requis)\n- content\n- username\n- llm_config (optionnel)\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Validate input\n2. Map guild_id → project_id + branding\n3. Call Process-Question\n4. Call Format-Response\n5. Return MentionResult",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "mention-handler-note",
      "name": "Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -288,
        192
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "mention",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "mention-handler-0001",
      "name": "Webhook Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        304
      ],
      "webhookId": "mention-webhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// ============================================\n// VALIDATE INPUT (RFC-007 + RFC-009)\n// ============================================\n\nconst input = $input.first().json;\nconst body = input.body || input;\n\n// --- Validate required fields ---\nconst errors = [];\n\nif (!body.guild_id) errors.push('guild_id requis');\nif (!body.user_id) errors.push('user_id requis');\nif (body.content === undefined) errors.push('content requis');\n\nif (errors.length > 0) {\n  return {\n    valid: false,\n    error: {\n      code: 'VALIDATION_ERROR',\n      message: errors.join(', '),\n      http_status: 400\n    }\n  };\n}\n\n// --- Extract LLM config (RFC-009) ---\nconst llmConfig = body.llm_config || {};\n\n// --- Return validated data ---\nreturn {\n  valid: true,\n  data: {\n    message_id: body.message_id || null,\n    channel_id: body.channel_id || null,\n    guild_id: body.guild_id,\n    user_id: body.user_id,\n    content: body.content || '',\n    username: body.username || 'unknown',\n    display_name: body.display_name || body.username || 'unknown',\n    is_reply: body.is_reply || false,\n    replied_to_bot: body.replied_to_bot || false,\n    conversation_id: body.conversation_id || null\n  },\n  llm_config: {\n    provider: llmConfig.provider || null,\n    openai_api_key: llmConfig.openai_api_key || null,\n    anthropic_api_key: llmConfig.anthropic_api_key || null,\n    google_api_key: llmConfig.google_api_key || null,\n    mistral_api_key: llmConfig.mistral_api_key || null\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "mention-handler-0002",
      "name": "Validate Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        224,
        304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
